          <data key="d100">Glycogen [starch] synthase, liver</data>
          <data key="d101">Glycogen synthase 2</data>
          <data key="d104">Glycogen synthase participates in the glycogen biosynthetic process along with glycogenin and glycogen branching enzyme. Extends the primer composed of a few glucose units formed by glycogenin by adding new glucose units to it.</data>
